*.log
# vector_store/ IS TRACKED ON PURPOSE.
# Ignoring it was tried — 16 MB of binaries in every diff — and it breaks the
# deployment: the Railway Dockerfile does `COPY . .` and takes the index from the
# repository, so ignoring it ships an app with no index, and document questions
# return nothing with no error to give it away.
# Ignoring it would first require building the index at startup or mounting it in
# a volume. While the index travels in the image, it stays in git.
